{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main2010_system_01",
      "hash": "79db968c6abc4acb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "成為冠軍之後，\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的世界變得更加寬闊了……！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main2010_system_02",
      "hash": "79db978c6abc4c7e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "現在[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳可以和\\n[VAR COLOR(0006)]噴火龍[VAR COLOR(0000)]、[VAR COLOR(0006)]化石翼龍[VAR COLOR(0000)]還有[VAR COLOR(0006)]快龍[VAR COLOR(0000)]一起\\r\\n高高飛向天空，前往任何地方了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main2010_shortpants_01",
      "hash": "3809042d727f52d8",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "不好意思打斷[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳開拓視野的時間。\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳現在有空嗎！？"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main2010_shortpants_02",
      "hash": "3809072d727f57f1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "還記得我嗎？\\n我是１號道路的太一！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main2010_shortpants_03",
      "hash": "3809062d727f563e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我有一個消息要告訴\\n成功當上了冠軍的[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳。"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main2010_shortpants_04",
      "hash": "3809092d727f5b57",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "有一群被稱為[VAR COLOR(0006)]大師訓練家[VAR COLOR(0000)]的人\\n出現在關都地區了喔。\\c\\n所謂大師訓練家，就是將\\n單一種寶可夢鑽研到了極致的人！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main2010_shortpants_11",
      "hash": "3806002d727d1635",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "建議[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳可以先去\\n挑戰皮卡丘大師！\\r\\n那傢伙就在常青森林裡！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main2010_shortpants_12",
      "hash": "3805fd2d727d111c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "建議[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳可以先去\\n挑戰伊布大師！\\r\\n那傢伙就在寶可夢大道！"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main2010_shortpants_05",
      "hash": "3809082d727f59a4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳如果想知道詳情，\\n就來找我說話吧。"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main2010_shortpants_06",
      "hash": "38090b2d727f5ebd",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳想知道大師訓練家的\\n什麼事情呢？"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main2010_select_01",
      "hash": "40ba21cc7b2222c8",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "他們是什麼樣的一群人？"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main2010_select_02",
      "hash": "40ba24cc7b2227e1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "要怎樣才能和他們對戰？"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main2010_select_03",
      "hash": "40ba23cc7b22262e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "關於稱號"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_main2010_select_04",
      "hash": "40ba26cc7b222b47",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "退出"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_main2010_shortpants_07",
      "hash": "38090a2d727f5d0a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "所謂大師訓練家，\\n就是將單一種寶可夢\\r\\n鑽研到了極致的訓練家！\\c\\n因為他們隨時都在想著\\n自己鑽研的那種寶可夢，\\r\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳看到的時候應該馬上就能認出來！"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_main2010_shortpants_08",
      "hash": "3808fd2d727f46f3",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "如果[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳也持有\\n他們所鑽研的那種寶可夢，\\r\\n就能和他們進行一對一對戰。\\c\\n對戰時雙方都不能使用道具，\\n只能靠實力來決勝負！\\c\\n如果贏過他們就能獲得稱號，\\n之後[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳就可以用那個稱號來稱呼自己喔！"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "msg_main2010_shortpants_09",
      "hash": "3808fc2d727f4540",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "得到的稱號可以在\\n玉虹市的遊戲公司那裡更換！\\c\\n這樣一來[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳就能在連線對戰時\\n顯示出自己的與眾不同了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "id": "msg_main2010_shortpants_10",
      "hash": "3805ff2d727d1482",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "加油吧！"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_main_event_2010_max",
      "hash": "4f6ff97a5ec1a284"
    }
  ]
}
